See also |Sensor Shields| in Bridle and Zephyr sample:
:external+zephyr:zephyr:code-sample:`bme280`.

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/sensor/bme280
      :build-dir: mini_usb_rp2040
      :board: mini_usb_rp2040/rp2040
      :shield: "grove_sens_bmp280"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

You should see the following message on the console:

